## Baseline Caveat

This plan is based on the current working tree. Both EasyNet-Cli and EasyNet-Axon currently contain uncommitted changes. Before turning this into an implementation commit sequence, compare the current workspace against `main` or another agreed baseline and update the table if any rows are already landed, reverted, or experimental.
